<title>CHINA: Dragagues wins $107 mln Jakarta contract.</title>
<headline>Dragagues wins $107 mln Jakarta contract.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dragagues et Travaux Publics said on Monday its unit PT Dragagues Indonesia had won a US$107 million contract to design and build a four-tower residential complex in Jakarta.</p>
<p>Dragagues et Travaux said in a statement the four 44-storey residential blocks were being developed by PT Kuningan Persada, a member of the Danamon Group.</p>
<p>It said works began on July 1 and would be completed in two years' time.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
